[SIZE=5][B]💬 Community Notes[/B][/SIZE]

[LIST]
[*][B]Thanks[/B]: huge thanks to Patrick Braun ([ICODE]@PaddyBraun[/ICODE]) in [ICODE]@ExpressiveLauncherFeedback[/ICODE] for reporting the [ICODE]5.2.0[/ICODE] ExpressiveOS system accent mismatch with Quick Settings, App Drawer, and Launcher Settings screenshots—those screenshots pinned down the exact [ICODE]0 -> GOOGLE_BLUE + Style.EXPRESSIVE[/ICODE] code path.
[*][B]Free Core & Developer Support[/B]: Expressive Core continues to ship all core daily-driver launcher functionality for free. Expressive Pro is available as a one-time $4.99 activation. Every dollar funds our ongoing build servers, Android 17 test devices/emulators, and signing pipelines—keeping Expressive fast, independent, and completely ad-free.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🧩 Release Riddle[/B][/SIZE]

[QUOTE][I]I pass zero to a color engine, get Google Blue back, spin it 240 degrees, and turn your olive phone mint and burgundy. What am I?[/I][/QUOTE]

[SPOILER="Tap to reveal answer"][B]A cache miss on [ICODE]Pair(0, Style.EXPRESSIVE)[/ICODE]![/B] 5.2.1 caches [ICODE]SystemColorScheme[/ICODE] directly on Android 12+ so System Accent always reads your real OS palette. 🎨[/SPOILER]

[HR][/HR]

